  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\nNo. 69 Carrowmore Meadows, Knock, Co. Mayo\nLuxury 2 Bedroom Semi-Detached Bungalow\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this beautifully maintained two-bedroom semi-detached bungalow located within the exclusive Carrowmore Meadows Retirement Village, just a short walk from Knock Shrine and all village amenities.\n\nThis attractive retirement development is professionally managed and maintained to an exceptional standard, offering peaceful, secure and independent living in a superb location.\n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance hallway\n\nBright lounge with open fireplace\nFrench doors leading to a modern \n\nfitted kitchen/dining room with appliances included\n\nTwo spacious double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\n\nFully fitted modern bathroom\n\nHallway storage\n\nFloored attic providing excellent additional storage\n\nOutside\nThe property enjoys a private enclosed rear garden with separate access. To the front there is private parking together with a well-maintained lawn. \n\nAll communal gardens, landscaped areas and shrubbery are professionally maintained by the management company.\n\nThe annual management fee is approximately €1,500, which includes exterior maintenance, lawn care, rubbish collection, security alarm monitoring and the upkeep of all communal gardens and landscaped areas.\n\nFeatures\nExclusive Retirement Village\nWalking Distance to Knock Shrine\nGas Fired Central Heating\nTwo Spacious Double Bedrooms\nFully Fitted Kitchen with Appliances Included\nOpen Fireplace\nBuilt-in Wardrobes\nFloored Attic for Additional Storage\nPrivate Rear Garden\nExcellent Decorative Condition Throughout\n\nLocation\nIdeally situated within walking distance of Knock Shrine, church, shops and local amenities. Ireland West Airport Knock is just a short drive away, while Claremorris, Ballyhaunis and the N17 are all easily accessible.\n\nGuide Price: Offers in Excess of €190,000\n\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment only with the sole selling agents.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\nMIPAV MMCEPI\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\n\nRoscommon Office: 086 2130723\nClaremorris Office: 094 9362216\nEmail: nigeldineenauctioneer@gmail.com\nEmail: enquiries@finnauctioneers.com\n\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\n\nDisclaimer: These particulars, including measurements, floor areas and property size, are for guidance only and may contain errors. They do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided.",
